-- 97: THREE-AND-ONE. d1 plays 3 bars of one break then 1 bar of another; d6 does the
-- same with the two arps. A 4-bar cycle, so the swap is predictable instead of
-- churning every bar. Everything else rides as in 96.
-- Parent 96.tidal. Needs sc/samples94.scd.






